            "body": "<p>In a study of 3,019 five-year-old children, symptoms of sleep-disordered breathing were associated with approximately 2.5× higher odds of hyperactivity and 2.1× higher odds of inattention. These are odds ratios, not ADHD diagnoses or proof of causation.</p>",
